--- a/CONTRIBUTING.md
+++ b/CONTRIBUTING.md
@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@ Our open source community strives to be nice, welcoming and professional. Instan
 
 * Day.js is written in ES6.
 * We use ESLint to check our code. You can use `npm run lint` before submitting a pull request.
+* The bundled type declarations live in `types/`. If you change one, run `npm run type-check`, which compiles them with `tsconfig.json`. `test/types.test.js` runs the same check, and also compares every declaration against what the plugin installs at runtime.
 * Please use semantic commit message.
 
 ## Bugs
