+  // over one stamp. A month name is looked up through `getLocalePart`, which concatenates both
+  // arms of a two-arm locale into a 24-entry array, so an index taken from it can be wrong for
+  // a single month while every other month in the same locale and the same format is right.
+  // A sweep pinned to one date crosses 143 locales and 6 formats and still cannot see that.
